 "title": "Welcome to Dodge County, MN",
 "text": "Welcome to Dodge County, MN\nSearch toggle\nDodge County, MN\nHome\nDepartments\n-Administration\nCounty Administrator\nEmployee Relations\nExtension\nFinance\nInformation Technology\n-Attorney\n-Court Administration\n-Court Services/Probation\n-Drug Court\n-Economic Development Authority\n-Emergency Management\n-Environmental Services\nGarbage/Recycling\nRenovation ReUse\nSeptic Systems\nWater Quality\nZoning\n-Extension\n-Fairview Care Center\n-Highway Department\nParks and Trails\n-Human Services (MNPrairie)\n-Land Records\nAssessor\nRecorder\nGIS & Maps\nSurveyor\n-Public Health\n-Sheriff\n-Soil & Water Conservation District\n-Veteran Services\n-Victim Services\n-Women's Shelter\nGovernment\nCounty Board\nDistrict 1\nDistrict 2\nDistrict 3\nDistrict 4\nDistrict 5\nBoard Agendas & Minutes\nI Want To\n-Apply for...\n-Connect to Social Media...\n-Contact...\nThe Midway Calendar\n-Find...\n-Live in Dodge County...\n-Pay or Purchase...\n-Play...\n-Request...\n-Report...\n-Volunteer...\n-View Photo Gallery\n-Learn about COVID-19...\n-Work\nContact Us\nSelect Language ​ ▼\nTRANSLATE\nAfrikaans\nAlbanian\nArabic\nArmenian\nAzerbaijani\nBasque\nBelarusian\nBengali\nBosnian\nBulgarian\nCatalan\nCebuano\nChinese (Simplified)\nChinese (Traditional)\nCroatian\nCzech\nDanish\nDutch\nEnglish\nEsperanto\nEstonian\nFilipino\nFinnish\nFrench\nGalician\nGeorgian\nGerman\nGreek\nGujarati\nHaitian Creole\nHausa\nHebrew\nHindi\nHmong\nHungarian\nIcelandic\nIgbo\nIndonesian\nIrish\nItalian\nJapanese\nJavanese\nKannada\nKhmer\nKorean\nLao\nLatin\nLatvian\nLithuanian\nMacedonian\nMalay\nMaltese\nMaori\nMarathi\nMongolian\nNepali\nNorwegian\nPersian\nPolish\nPortuguese\nPunjabi\nRomanian\nRussian\nSerbian\nSlovak\nSlovenian\nSomali\nSpanish\nSwahili\nSwedish\nTamil\nTelugu\nThai\nTurkish\nUkrainian\nUrdu\nVietnamese\nWelsh\nYiddish\nYoruba\nZulu\nGo\nPrev Next\nLand Records\nSub Menu\nLand Records\nAssessor\nValue and Classification Appeals\nAbatements and Disaster Credits\nAssessor's Duties\nHomesteads\nFrequently Asked Questions\nLinks\nImportant Dates\nTax Searches\nMobile Home Title Transfer\nRecorder\nBirth Certificates\nDeath Certificates\nDrivers Licenses\nMarriage Licenses\nOrdinations\nProperty Watch\nGIS/Maps\nSurveyor\nHome Land Records\nOur building hours are 8:00 am - 4:30 pm.\nLand Records provides many services to the public in one location. The Director of Land Records, Ryan DeCook, acts as the County Assessor and the County Recorder. We are comprised of Assessment Services, Recording Services, Geographical Information Systems (GIS), and Surveying.\nSee below for a brief description and contact information for each area.\nAssessment Services:\nIdentifying, classifying, and valuing real property and some personal property for ad valorum taxation purposes\nHomesteading\nRecording Services:\nRecording of land documents such as deeds, mortgages, contracts, mechanics liens, mortgage assignments, releases, etc.\nRecording of official plats of land in both city and rural areas\nVital Records such as birth certificates, death certificates, marriage records and licensing, filing notary public, etc.\nRenewing driver's licenses, permits, and state ID cards\nPassport photos\nGeographical Information Systems (GIS):\nParcel based mapping and identification of parcels\nSurveying:\nLocate County section and quarter corners\nOversees plats, surveys, and splits\nContact Phone Numbers:\nAssessor: (507) 635-6245\nCounty Surveyor: (651) 385-3197\nGIS: (651) 385-3193\nRecorder & Vitals: (507) 635-6250\n© 2019 Dodge County, MN\n| Accessibility\n| Contact Us\nPowered by\n, The Government Website Experts |\nLogin\nSHARE\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.co.dodge.mn.us/departments/land_records/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate",
